WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.267
Former Vice President

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.302
Pence today said

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.236
his old boss

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.838
should not face charges

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:05.872
based on today's select

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:06.439
committee referral.

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:09.743
He said that today on warehouse Fox

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:11.611
and he also said this

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:14.581
I must say from very early

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.483
on, I've been disappointed

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:18.485
in the partizan nature

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.154
of the select committee on Capitol Hill.

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.590
I made to have a committee

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.059
that was literally appointed

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:27.060
in its entirety

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.229
by the Democrat speaker of the House

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:31.031
really violates the history

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.565
and tradition of the Congress.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.433
The United States.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:34.801
This select committee from

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.536
the very beginning has

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:39.706
has as represented a kind of a partizan

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:41.207
taint that I think

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.075
it's one of the reasons

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:43.810
why so few Americans

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:44.811
are paying much attention

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:45.812
to what happened today

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:47.280
or to the results

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.815
or recommendations of this committee.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.418
Keeping Them Honest, the

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:52.419
